Given this setup we define the Folklore set on $m\times n$ matrices with arbitrary norms as
\begin{equation*}
    FS_{m,n}(\|\cdot\|_{1},\|\cdot\|_{2})=Di_{m,n}(\|\cdot\|_{1},\|\cdot\|_{2})\backslash \left(Bad_{m,n} \cup Sing_{m,n} \right)
\end{equation*}
and, for any $0<c<D$, the smaller set
\begin{equation*}
     FS_{m,n}(\|\cdot\|_{1},\|\cdot\|_{2},c)=DI_{m,n}(\|\cdot\|_{1},\|\cdot\|_{2},c)\backslash Bad_{m,n}.
\end{equation*}

